WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.959
Registration connects a device to your fleet, so updates and
reports belong to the right machine. Let’s start with one
device.

2
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:14.757
Choose Devices. For a small pilot, register the identity created
by the installed device client.

3
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:21.941
Choose Register by address. Copy the public identity from device
setup; keep its private key on the device.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.751
Register the device and approve the request in your wallet.

5
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:33.346
The new device appears in your fleet. Registration and online
status are different: the client still needs to report.

6
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:40.266
Your device is registered. Start its configured client and check
for a report before treating it as online.
